      "fact": "After PREPARING, typed bundle/revision/origin and approved snapshot immutable; result cannot change while state unchanged; only PENDING_FREEZE->COMPLETE is allowed, with original completion time. DELETE/TRUNCATE refuse. Private receipt table revokes all ordinary/service roles."
