      "fact": "Callback intentionally matches pending Local receipt JSON bundle ID, checks actual publication receipt bundle/revision/digest/member-root then strict family/generation/event identities, completes retained receipt/run/request and invokes exact Source release proof. It does not create or reassign a bundle."
